kedin_post": {"text": "LINKEDIN POST:\n\nRetention and RTP just became a single line item on an invoice.\n\nEvoverse launched a source-code crypto casino platform on July 28, letting operators fully own their tech stack instead of renting it. A branded casino goes live in about a month, and it ships with VIP tiers, rakeback, challenges and reward systems already built in.\n\nHere's the part worth sitting with: the same one-time purchase also hands operators full control over margins and RTP configuration. The system that decides how much a player loses and the system that convinces them to come back and lose more are now sold in the same package, configured by the same person.\n\nFor years those were separate functions with separate incentives - a product team tuning math, a VIP team protecting relationships. Collapsing them into one dashboard is efficient. It also removes the last internal check that ever asked whether a retention tactic made sense for the player, not just the P&L.\n\nThe best operators will use that control to build fairer, more transparent programs. The rest will use it exactly how it sounds.\n\nWhich operator do you want to be?\n\n#iGaming #VIPRetention #CasinoOperations #PlayerExperience"}}